 d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"/services\"><span>주요 업무</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"/cases\"><span>손해사정 사례</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"/partners\"><span>협력사</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"/contact\"><span>상담 문의</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></li></ul>\n  <div class=\"mnav-info\">\n    <a href=\"tel:01051142465\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2\"/></svg><span>010-5114-2465</span></a>\n    <p>전남광주통합특별시 북구 문화소통로 170, 1002-V6호</p>\n    <p>연구소 : 전남광주통합특별시 북구 첨단연신로 45, 에이동 701호</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<main class=\"sub\" id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"sub-top wrap\">\n  <nav class=\"crumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\">\n    <a class=\"crumb-home\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"홈\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 11l9-7 9 7v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-6H9v6H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z\"/></svg></a><i class=\"dot\"></i>\n    <div class=\"crumb-dd\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">손해사정 사례<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button><ul><li><a href=\"/about\">사무소 소개</a></li><li><a href=\"/services\">주요 업무</a></li><li><a href=\"/cases\" class=\"on\">손해사정 사례</a></li><li><a href=\"/partners\">협력사</a></li><li><a href=\"/contact\">상담 문의</a></li></ul></div>\n  </nav>\n  <h1 class=\"sub-title\" data-rv>손해사정 사례</h1>\n  <p class=\"sub-lead\" data-rv>고객님의 소중한 권리를<br>되찾아 드린 실제 사례입니다.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"cv-wrap wrap\" aria-label=\"사례 상세\">\n  <div id=\"cms-root\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"bleed bleed--c\" aria-label=\"상담 안내\">\n  <div class=\"bleed-pic\" data-px=\"0.12\"><picture class=\"\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/img/pen-m.webp 960w, /assets/img/pen-l.webp 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"/assets/img/pen-l.jpg\" srcset=\"/assets/img/pen-m.jpg 960w, /assets/img/pen-l.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1442\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture></div>\n  <div class=\"bleed-txt wrap\" data-rv>\n    <p class=\"eyebrow eyebrow--g\">Free Consultation</p>\n    <h2>끝까지 함께 하겠습니다.</h2>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"/contact\">무료 상담 신청</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"band\" aria-labelledby=\"band-t\">\n  <div class=\"band-in wrap\">\n    <div class=\"band-l\" data-rv>\n      <h2 id=\"band-t\">상담 신청을 남겨주시면<br>확인 후 연락드립니다.</h2>\n      <a class=\"band-tel\" href=\"tel:01051142465\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2\"/></svg><span>010-5114-2465</span></a>\n      <p>기초 상담 및 가능성 검토는 100% 무료로 진행됩니다.</p>\n    </div>\n    <form class=\"qform js-form\" name=\"contact-form\" method=\"POST\" data-netlify=\"true\" data-rv>\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form-name\" value=\"contact-form\">\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source\" value=\"quick\">\n      <div class=\"qrow\">\n        <label><span>이름 <em>*</em></span><input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"고객님 성함\"></label>\n        <label><span>연락처 <em>*</em></span><input type=\"tel\" name=\"phone\" required autocomplete=\"tel\" inputmode=\"tel\" placeholder=\"010-0000-0000\"></label>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"qmsg\"><span>상담 내용</span><input type=\"text\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"사고 내용이나 궁금한 점을 간단히 적어주세요.\"></label>\n      <div class=\"agree\">\n  <div class=\"agree-top\"><b class=\"agree-h\">개인정보 수집·이용 동의 <em>(필수)</em></b>\n  <button class=\"agree-more\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"agree-band\">내용 보기</button></div>\n  <div class=\"agree-txt\" id=\"agree-band\" hidden>\n    <p><b>수집 항목</b> 이름, 휴대전화, 상담 내용</p>\n    <p><b>수집 방법</b> 홈페이지 상담 신청</p>\n    <p><b>이용 목적</b> 상담 신청 확인 및 회신, 손해사정 상담 진행</p>\n    <p><b>보유 기간</b> 개인정보 수집 및 이용목적이 달성된 후에는 예외 없이 해당 정보를 지체 없이 파기합니다.</p>\n    <p>동의를 거부할 수 있으며, 거부 시 상담 신청이 제한될 수 있습니다.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"agree-opts\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"개인정보 수집·이용 동의 여부\">\n    <label class=\"chk chk--r\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"agree\" value=\"동의\" required><i></i><span>동의합니다</span></label>\n    <label class=\"chk chk--r\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"agree\" value=\"미동의\"><i></i><span>동의하지 않습니다</span></label>\n  </div>\n</div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-bronze\" type=\"submit\">상담 신청하기 <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>\n      <p class=\"form-msg\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"ft\">\n  <div class=\"ft-top wrap\">\n    <div class=\"ft-brand\"><svg class=\"emb ft-emb\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"11 12 369 355\"><use href=\"/assets/img/emblem.svg#e\"/></svg><b>대동 손해사정사무소</b></div>\n    <ul class=\"ft-menu\"><li><a href=\"/about\">사무소 소개</a></li><li><a href=\"/services\">주요 업무</a></li><li><a href=\"/cases\">손해사정 사례</a></li><li><a href=\"/partners\">협력사</a></li><li><a href=\"/contact\">상담 문의</a></li></ul>\n    <a class=\"ft-ask\" href=\"/contact\"><span>더 궁금하신 점이<br>있으신가요?</span><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></i></a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ft-info wrap\">\n    <p><b>대동 손해사정사무소</b><span>대표 손해사정사 : 오승창</span><span>사업자등록번호 : 684-05-03061</span></p>\n    <p><span>주소 : 전남광주통합특별시 북구 문화소통로 170, 1002-V6호</span><span>연구소 : 전남광주통합특별시 북구 첨단연신로 45, 에이동 701호</span></p>\n    <p><span class=\"tel-pc\">Tel : <a href=\"tel:0627107055\">062-710-7055</a></span><span class=\"tel-m\">Tel : <a href=\"tel:01051142465\">010-5114-2465</a></span><span>Fax : 062-710-7056</span><span>Email : <a href=\"mailto:osc2001@naver.com\">osc2001@naver.com</a></span></p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ft-bottom wrap\"><span>© 2024 DAEDONG Claim Adjustment Office. All rights reserved.</span><a href=\"/contact#privacy\">개인정보처리방침</a></div>\n</footer>\n<div class=\"flt\" aria-label=\"빠른 메뉴\">\n  <a class=\"flt-b flt-call\" href=\"tel:01051142465\" aria-label=\"전화 바로걸기 010-5114-2465\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2\"/></svg><span>전화상담</span></a>\n  <a class=\"flt-b\" href=\"/contact#form\" aria-label=\"간편 상담 신청\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z\"/><path d=\"M8 9.5h8M8 12.5h5\"/></svg><span>상담신청</span></a>\n  <button class=\"flt-b flt-top\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"맨 위로\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 15l6-6 6 6\"/></svg><span>TOP</span></button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cur\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<script src=\"/assets/js/site.js?v=20261014c\" defer></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
